    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella,Minister of Higher Education and Highways, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission, do by thisOrder, amend the Schedule to the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1448/27 of June 09, 2006 establishingthe University of Colombo, Sri Lanka, which Order is deemed, by virtue of the provisions of Section 139 of the aforesaidAct, to be an Order made under Section 21 of the said Act, (as last amended by Order published in Gazette ExtraordinaryNo. 1979/20 of August 09, 2016), by the addition immediately after item \u201cFaculty of Science\u201d appearing in Column Iwhich corresponds to the entries in Column II of the Schedule of the following entry :-",
